    "title": "Not-Forgotten Box toy, food drive now underway - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sara Crawford The Gazette ,\n1 days ago MEDINA — The first day of the Not-Forgotten Box toy and food drive was on Monday, bringing in more than 100 toys for Medina County residents in need. The Medina Gazette holds the toy and food drive in partnership with the Medina Salvation Army to help people throughout the county during the holiday season. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
